17zq|n|A blow with the foot or feet; a striking or thrust with the foot. ; The projection on the tang of the blade of a pocket knife, which prevents the edge of the blade from striking the spring. See Illust. of Pocketknife. ; A projection in a mold, to form a depression in the surface of the brick. ; The recoil of a musket or other firearm, when discharged.	n:tep,58,6~tep,58,6	N:5d6,90,3;1iek,14,3~1iek,14,3;5d6,90,3
